    "created_at": "2015-09-04T21:43:00Z",
    "updated_at": "2015-09-04T21:43:00Z",
    "body": "CG also has low/medium/high, and makes no guarantees of what algorithms those values correspond to. Given Skia and CG agree on this, I'm inclined to not expose actual algorithm names. This also allows future browsers greater flexibility if new algorithms are developed.\n\nOK with you, @foolip?\n",
    "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
    "pin": null,
