    "updated_at": "2015-09-04T22:55:22Z",
    "body": "@ds-hwang, thanks, looks like skia has 4 quality levels, and no guarantee about what algorithms they correspond do. Are there any exceptions to the \"typically\" in those descriptions?\n\n@hober, in practice, don't you know which algorithms those levels correspond to on each platform that you support?\n\nWhatever the answers are, I don't have much of a stake in `<canvas>`, so I'd prefer it if the relevant implementors got together and agreed on something. Please proceed :)\n",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
