    "created_at": "2015-09-05T08:02:30Z",
    "updated_at": "2015-09-05T08:02:30Z",
    "body": "If we use generic quality levels, will authors get upset when they find that a given quality level looks worse/different on one browser than another?\n",
    "author_association": "NONE",
    "pin": null,
