    "created_at": "2015-10-28T05:06:18Z",
    "updated_at": "2015-10-28T05:06:18Z",
    "body": "More important than what?\n\nWith vague \"low\", \"medium\" and \"high\" values I think authors will build their expectations on what the browsers they test with do, and then we'll experience de-facto standardization. I guess opinions can vary on how beneficial that process will be.\n",
